# Chronikon Knowledge Graph API Contract

## GET /health
- Returns API status.

## GET /repo/:id/graph
- Returns the complete graph (nodes + edges).

Response example:
{
  "nodes": [],
  "edges": []
}

## GET /repo/:id/files
- Returns list of File nodes.

## GET /repo/:id/commits
- Returns list of Commit nodes.

## GET /repo/:id/contributors
- Returns list of Contributor nodes.
